## Original Content
Les Forces démocratiques syriennes, dont le chef Mazloum Abdi a annoncé, mardi, la dissolution en vertu d'un accord avec le président Ahmed al-Charaa, constituaient l'armée des Kurdes de Syrie et avaient vaincu avec le soutien de l'Occident les jihadistes du groupe État islamique.

## Summary
The Syrian Democratic Forces (SDF) have announced their dissolution following an agreement with Syrian President Ahmed al-Sharaa. Led by Mazloum Abdi, the SDF was a key Kurdish military force that played a significant role in defeating the Islamic State in Syria with Western backing.

## Key Points
- The Syrian Democratic Forces (SDF) are dissolving as per an agreement with the Syrian government.
- The dissolution was announced by SDF chief Mazloum Abdi and involves President Ahmed al-Sharaa.
- The SDF was instrumental in combating the Islamic State in Syria.
- Western countries provided support to the SDF in their fight against jihadists.


